			"notes": "- Improved spawn safety, distance checks, and support for mob spawning rules.\n- Riderless mounts now count toward spawn limits; named pets are exempt.\n- Added admin commands: `/undeadriders count` and `/undeadriders count <type>`, listing named pets separately.\n- Added `/undeadriders highlight on|off`: matching mounts glow for 30 seconds when counted. Disabled by default, per admin.\n- Fixed sunlight protection for triggered Skeleton Horse traps and saddled horses while preserving fire from other sources.\n- Improved config validation, file safety, and update checking."
		},
